            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.14.14

- Fixed YouTube Music and other browser players not being detected after audio was sent from an iPhone or iPad.
- The cover from your phone now stays on screen when you pause it, instead of switching back to whatever played before.
- Fixed the progress bar and lyrics running on, or jumping, while music from your phone was paused.
]]></description>
